  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Deploy loop",
      "items": [
        "git pull && sudo ./scripts/server.sh restart",
        "Order: secrets step, then build.sh --if-needed, then systemctl restart",
        "A failed install or build stops before any service restarts",
        "restart app bounces only the web app; the harness keeps running"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Names, never values",
      "items": [
        "config holds keys such as DOMAIN, CONSOLE_DOMAIN, APP_PORT, HARNESS_PORT, SUPABASE_URL, BACKUP_S3_BUCKET",
        ".env.local gets HARNESS_URL, HARNESS_APP_SECRET, APP_SESSION_SECRET, SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY and more",
        "The secrets step also writes the harness console login and app bearer under harness/.secrets",
        "Generated secrets are reused across restarts; scripts print confirmations only"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Read with care",
      "items": [
        "Units are <APP_NAME>-app and <APP_NAME>-harness (blank APP_NAME = checkout folder); the README calls them rosie-app and rosie-harness",
        "Only the harness console binds 127.0.0.1; next start sets just PORT, so :3000 listens on all interfaces unless a firewall closes it (scripts/contabo/setup.sh allows only SSH, 80, 443)",
        "Backups run only when BACKUP_S3_BUCKET is set; daily 03:00 UTC unless BACKUP_EVERY_HOURS is 1–23; S3 keeps the newest BACKUP_KEEP zips (default 14)",
        "The zip covers files on the server, not the business data held in Supabase"
      ]
    }
  ]
